cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the findings it produces, please cite it as below."
title: "Project Organica: A Developmental Machine Intelligence"
abstract: >-
  Project Organica is an experimental architecture for machine intelligence that
  grows its cognitive structures from a raw experience stream through repeated
  sleep/consolidation cycles, rather than loading pre-trained weights. Concepts,
  loops, workflows, hypotheses, theories, questions, dreams, investigations and
  experiments are synthesised structurally from the layer below, under six
  inviolable design laws governing upward induction, verified structural
  provenance, cognitive isolation, grounded dreaming, epistemic attention, and
  natural selection.
type: software
version: 0.12.0
